flowchart TD
 S[Student] --> UI[Streamlit Interface]
 UI --> C[AI Study Chat]
 UI --> R[Document RAG]
 UI --> Q[Quiz Generator]
 UI --> T[Study Planner]
 R --> E[Extract PDF DOCX TXT]
 E --> CH[Chunk Text]
 CH --> EM[Embedding API]
 EM --> RET[Similarity Retrieval]
 RET --> C
 C --> LLM[LLM API]
 Q --> LLM
 LLM --> A[Agent Function Calling]
 A --> CALC[Calculator Tool]
 A --> DB[(SQLite Task Database)]
 LLM --> OUT[Answer / Quiz / Action Result]
 OUT --> UI
